  "content": {
    "prompt": "Write Python code that sets level to 3 and xp to 250. If xp is greater than or equal to 300, add 2 to level and store it back. Else if xp is greater than or equal to 200, add 1 to level and subtract 200 from xp, storing both back. Otherwise, set xp to 0. Print level and then print xp.",
    "source_code": "level = 3\nxp = 250\nif xp >= 300:\n    level = level + 2\nelif xp >= 200:\n    level = level + 1\n    xp = xp - 200\nelse:\n    xp = 0\nprint(level)\nprint(xp)\n"
  },
